One of the reasons why I think that I have never come close to winning
Nethack (despite having once scored 163,483 with 116 hit points) is that I 
don't know how to easily identify things.  

Scrolls and potions are ok because you can try them, same with wands and 
armour.  The most difficult things are weapons, rings and amulets.  When
I get a scroll of identify I will always identify weapons last because
they cannot hurt you (unless they are cursed), then I find out when I'm
dead that I was carrying a +3 elven dagger or something.

What other ways are there of finding out what things are?  I always get to
about level 10 carrying about loads of stuff and leaving piles in corners
and chests waiting to find a scroll of identify, and then get killed by
something I probably had the means to defeat.

This is the single most frustrating thing about the game.  Any help would be
gratefully accepted.
